---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}/></head><body><Header/>
<main class="home">
<section class="hero-approved">
  <div class="hero-approved-copy">
    <h1>Financing for your next investment property, with a partner <em>in your corner.</em></h1>
    <p>Explore DSCR rental loans, fix-and-flip financing, and commercial and business-purpose loan options built around real estate investors.</p>
    <a class="approved-cta" href="/#loan-programs">Explore Loan Programs <span>→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="report-promo"><div class="report-promo-inner"><div class="report-promo-copy"><div class="report-promo-kicker">FREE PROPERTY REPORT</div><h2>Know more before you make an offer.</h2><p>Create your own property report with an estimated value, available comparable properties, and useful property research. Then save or print your report as a PDF and move forward with more confidence.</p><a class="report-promo-button" href="/tools/property-report">Create My Free Property Report <span>↗</span></a><small>Free to use · No obligation · Property research, not an appraisal</small></div><div class="report-promo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><div class="report-sheet"><span>PROPERTY REPORT</span><b>PROPERTY<br/>AT A GLANCE</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><strong>PDF</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="approved-programs" id="loan-programs">
  <h2><span></span>Our Investment Loan Programs<span></span></h2>
  <div class="approved-program-grid">
    <a href="/apply"><b class="program-icon">DSCR</b><strong>DSCR Rental Loans</strong><small>Financing based on<br/>rental income.</small></a>
    <a href="/apply"><b class="program-icon">⚒</b><strong>Fix &amp; Flip Loans</strong><small>Short-term financing<br/>for your next project.</small></a>
    <a href="/apply"><b class="program-icon">⌁</b><strong>Bridge Loans</strong><small>Quick financing for<br/>time-sensitive opportunities.</small></a>
    <a href="/apply"><b class="program-icon">▦</b><strong>Commercial &amp; Business<br/>Purpose Loans</strong><small>Solutions for your business<br/>and investment needs.</small></a>
  </div>

  <div class="itin-feature">
    <div class="itin-photo" role="img" aria-label="ITIN loan documentation"></div>
    <div class="itin-copy"><h3>ITIN Loan Programs</h3><p>Financing options for eligible borrowers using an Individual Taxpayer Identification Number (ITIN) instead of a Social Security number.</p></div>
    <a class="approved-cta" href="/apply">Learn More <span>→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="toolkit"><div class="section-kicker">broker pal investor toolkit</div><h2>Make the next move with better information.</h2><p>Free tools to evaluate a property, understand a DSCR scenario, and compare financing options.</p><div class="toolkit-grid"><a href="/tools/dscr-calculator"><b>DSCR Calculator</b><span>Estimate coverage, NOI and cash flow ↗</span></a><a href="/tools/loan-comparison"><b>Loan Comparison</b><span>Compare rate, costs, down payment and prepayment ↗</span></a><a href="/tools/property-report"><b>Property Data Report</b><span>Build a printable property worksheet and research public records ↗</span></a><a href="/community"><b>Opportunity Circle</b><span>Meet the people behind the investment ↗</span></a><a href="/resources"><b>Investor Resource Center</b><span>Guides, checklists and financing basics ↗</span></a><a href="/investor-zone"><b>Investor Property Hub</b><span>Personalize your property workspace ↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="trust"><div><b>01</b><span>Investor-minded<br/>loan guidance</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Clear next steps<br/>and communication</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Financing options for<br/>rental properties</span></div></section>
<section class="intro"><div class="section-kicker">A BETTER WAY TO MOVE FORWARD</div><h2>Your investment strategy deserves a lending partner who gets it.</h2><p>Whether you're acquiring your next rental or refinancing a property already in your portfolio, we help you navigate the DSCR financing process with practical guidance and a personal point of contact.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know broker pal <span>→</span></a></section>

<section class="steps"><div><div class="section-kicker">SIMPLE. DIRECT. INVESTOR-FOCUSED.</div><h2>From first conversation to closing.</h2></div><div class="step-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Tell us about the property</h3><p>Share the basics of your investment and financing goals.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Review your options</h3><p>We help identify a path that fits the property and your objectives.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Move toward closing</h3><p>Stay informed on next steps as your loan moves through the process.</p></article></div><a class="button primary" href="/how-it-works">Explore the process <span>↗</span></a></section>

<section class="closing"><div><div class="section-kicker">READY FOR YOUR NEXT INVESTMENT?</div><h2>Let's talk about your next property.</h2><p>Start with a quick inquiry. We'll connect with you about the property and financing you're considering.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/apply">Get Started <span>↗</span></a></section>
</main><Footer/></body></html>
<style>
:global(html){background:#071827;scroll-behavior:smooth}
:global(body){margin:0;background:#071827;color:#edf5f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}
:global(main.home){width:100%;max-width:none;padding:0;margin:0;background:#071827}
:global(h1),:global(h2),:global(h3){color:#f4f8fa}
:global(a){transition:color .18s ease,background .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}
.hero{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:78px 34px 82px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;align-items:center;gap:54px;min-height:520px}
.eyebrow,.section-kicker{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2.1px;color:#5bd0c4}
.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}.eyebrow span{width:28px;height:2px;background:#5bd0c4}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,67px);line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-2.7px;color:#f4f8fa;margin:22px 0;max-width:690px}
.hero h1 em{display:block;color:#65d4c8;font-style:normal}
.lead{max-width:570px;color:#c0d0d9;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75}
.actions{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}
.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;font-size:14px;padding:14px 21px;border-radius:4px}
.primary{background:#55cbbf;color:#071d2c}.primary:hover{background:#79e0d5;color:#071d2c}
.secondary{border:1px solid #587184;color:#edf5f7}.secondary:hover{border-color:#65d4c8;color:#65d4c8}
.hero-note{font-size:12px;color:#9eb4c1;margin-top:24px;letter-spacing:.35px}
.hero-art{min-height:410px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 76% 24%,#1c5261 0,#102e45 40%,#091d2e 82%);border:1px solid #31566a;border-radius:7px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:26px 28px;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0005}
.hero-art:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(120deg,transparent 40%,#51cfc21a 100%);pointer-events:none}
.visual-top,.visual-bottom{position:relative;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
.visual-kicker,.visual-index,.visual-bottom{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.6px;font-weight:800;color:#b8d2d9}
.visual-index{color:#6dd7cb}
.visual-main{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:300px}
.visual-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;width:58%;padding:18px 0}
.visual-rule{display:block;width:38px;height:3px;background:#58d0c3;margin-bottom:20px}
.visual-brand{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.visual-brand strong{color:#65d6c9}
.visual-copy h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-1.8px;color:#fff;margin:20px 0 15px}
.visual-copy h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#69d7ca}
.visual-copy p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#c4d9df}
.city-art{position:absolute;width:69%;height:100%;right:-6%;bottom:0;opacity:.96}
.visual-bottom{border-top:1px solid #6dd7cb45;padding-top:14px;font-size:8px;color:#c1d7dd}
.visual-dot{width:5px;height:5px;background:#6dd7cb;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 5px}
.report-promo{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#102c43,#164354);border-top:1px solid #23485b;border-bottom:1px solid #23485b;color:#fff;padding:48px 30px}
.report-promo-inner{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px}
.report-promo-copy{max-width:760px}.report-promo-kicker{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#65d4c8}
.report-promo h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3.3vw,40px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-1.2px;color:#fff;margin:10px 0}
.report-promo p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#c8d8df;max-width:690px;margin:0 0 20px}
.report-promo-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 19px;background:#5bd0c4;color:#071d2c;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;border-radius:4px}
.report-promo small{display:block;margin-top:12px;color:#a9c0ca;font-size:11px}
.report-promo-mark{width:150px;height:175px;flex:0 0 150px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.report-sheet{position:relative;width:118px;height:150px;background:#f3f8f8;color:#102b40;padding:14px 12px;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 #5bd0c4;transform:rotate(4deg)}
.report-sheet span{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#087f82;font-weight:800}.report-sheet b{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.1;margin:13px 0}
.report-sheet i{display:block;height:4px;background:#d5e3e6;margin:7px 0;width:90%}.report-sheet i:nth-of-type(2){width:70%}.report-sheet i:nth-of-type(3){width:82%}
.report-sheet strong{position:absolute;right:10px;bottom:9px;font-size:10px;color:#087f82}
.toolkit{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:82px 30px}
.toolkit h2,.programs h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.5vw,43px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-1.4px;color:#f2f7f8;margin:14px 0}
.toolkit>p,.program-intro{color:#b7c9d2}
.toolkit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px;margin-top:30px}
.toolkit-grid a{display:grid;gap:7px;padding:24px;background:#0d2639;border:1px solid #29485b;border-left:4px solid #55cbbf;text-decoration:none}
.toolkit-grid a:hover{background:#123349;border-color:#4d9d9b}
.toolkit-grid b{font-size:18px;color:#f4f8fa}.toolkit-grid span{font-size:13px;color:#b7c9d2}
.trust{background:#0d2b3e;border-top:1px solid #24475a;border-bottom:1px solid #24475a;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(25px,8vw,110px);padding:30px 24px}
.trust div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.trust b{font-size:25px;color:#62d2c6}.trust span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#d4e0e5}
.intro{max-width:850px;margin:auto;text-align:center;padding:92px 28px}
.intro h2,.steps h2,.closing h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.5vw,43px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-1.4px;color:#f4f8fa;margin:16px 0}
.intro p{color:#bdcdd5;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8}.text-link{display:inline-block;color:#65d4c8;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin-top:12px}
.programs{padding:82px 30px;max-width:1160px;margin:auto}.program-intro{max-width:650px}
.program-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:32px}
.program-grid article{padding:28px;background:#0d2639;border:1px solid #29485b;border-top:3px solid #55cbbf}
.program-grid article>span{color:#65d4c8;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.program-grid h3{color:#f2f7f8;font-size:20px;margin:13px 0 8px}
.program-grid p{color:#b7c9d2;font-size:14px;min-height:70px}
.program-grid a{color:#65d4c8;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}
.steps{background:#0b2234;border-top:1px solid #23465a;border-bottom:1px solid #23465a;padding:78px max(28px,calc((100% - 1120px)/2))}
.steps h2{max-width:440px}
.step-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;margin:35px 0}
.step-grid article{background:#102d42;padding:28px;border:1px solid #2a4a5e;border-top:3px solid #55cbbf}
.step-grid article>b{color:#65d4c8;font-size:13px}.step-grid h3{font-size:19px;color:#f4f8fa;margin:14px 0 8px}
.step-grid p{font-size:14px;color:#bdcdd5;margin:0}
.closing{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#164354,#102c43);color:#fff;padding:58px max(28px,calc((100% - 1120px)/2));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px;border-top:1px solid #2d5967}
.closing h2{color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px}.closing p{color:#c7d8df;margin:0;max-width:590px}.closing .section-kicker{color:#72dace}
.light{background:#f2f8f8;color:#102b40;white-space:nowrap}
@media(max-width:800px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:54px 25px 60px;gap:35px}.hero-art{min-height:330px}.visual-main{min-height:240px}.city-art{width:70%;right:-12%}.visual-copy{width:65%}.trust{gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-start}.trust div{min-width:40%}.step-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.closing{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.intro{padding:68px 25px}.program-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.program-grid p{min-height:0}}
@media(max-width:650px){.toolkit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.report-promo{padding:38px 24px}.report-promo-inner{gap:10px}.report-promo-mark{width:90px;flex-basis:90px;transform:scale(.8);transform-origin:center right}.report-promo-button{font-size:13px;padding:13px 14px}}
@media(max-width:460px){.hero h1{font-size:43px;letter-spacing:-1.8px}.hero-art{min-height:285px;padding:20px}.visual-main{min-height:210px}.visual-copy h2{font-size:34px}.city-art{width:78%;right:-22%;opacity:.72}.visual-index{display:none}.visual-bottom{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1px}.trust div{min-width:100%}}
</style>
<style>
:global(html),:global(body),:global(main.home){background:#002447!important;color:#f7f9fc!important}
:global(body){font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
.hero-approved{min-height:455px;max-width:none;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;padding:38px max(5.1vw,28px);background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#002447 0%,#002447 29%,rgba(0,36,71,.94) 38%,rgba(0,36,71,.28) 67%,rgba(0,36,71,.08) 100%),url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=88');background-size:cover;background-position:center 48%;}
.hero-approved-copy{max-width:610px;position:relative;z-index:1}.hero-approved h1{font-size:clamp(40px,4.3vw,58px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.8px;color:#f8fbff;margin:0 0 22px;font-weight:800}.hero-approved h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#19d0d0}.hero-approved p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#f1f5fa;max-width:540px;margin:0 0 22px}.approved-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:28px;background:#18d0d0;color:#002447;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap}.approved-cta:hover{background:#61e5e0;color:#002447}
.approved-programs{padding:4px max(2.7vw,20px) 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#002447,#00213f)}.approved-programs>h2{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:30px;color:#f8fbff;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(25px,2.6vw,34px);line-height:1.2;margin:0 auto 16px;max-width:1400px}.approved-programs>h2 span{height:2px;background:#13d0d0;flex:1}.approved-program-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;max-width:1450px;margin:0 auto 24px}.approved-program-grid a{min-height:168px;border:2px solid #12d2d2;border-radius:13px;background:rgba(0,34,66,.85);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;color:#f8fbff;padding:12px 14px;gap:4px}.approved-program-grid a:hover{background:#07395b}.program-icon{font-size:43px;line-height:1.15;color:#f8fbff}.approved-program-grid strong{font-size:19px;line-height:1.1}.approved-program-grid small{font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;color:#f0f5fa;margin-top:5px}.itin-feature{max-width:1450px;margin:auto;min-height:145px;border:2px solid #12d2d2;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(0,34,66,.9)}.itin-photo{width:30%;align-self:stretch;min-height:145px;background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-6726b3ff858f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85');background-size:cover;background-position:center}.itin-copy{flex:1;border-left:4px solid #12d2d2;padding:4px 20px 4px 36px}.itin-copy h3{font-size:29px;line-height:1.15;color:#f8fbff;margin:0 0 7px}.itin-copy p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;color:#f2f6fb;margin:0}.itin-feature>.approved-cta{margin:0 28px 0 0;padding:17px 30px}
.report-promo{margin-top:35px}
@media(max-width:850px){.hero-approved{min-height:420px;background-position:58% center}.hero-approved-copy{max-width:520px}.approved-program-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.itin-feature{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;padding-bottom:18px}.itin-photo{width:34%;min-height:150px}.itin-copy{padding-left:20px}.itin-feature>.approved-cta{margin:0 18px 0 auto}}
@media(max-width:560px){.hero-approved{min-height:470px;padding:38px 22px;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,36,71,.96),rgba(0,36,71,.73)),url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=82');background-position:center}.hero-approved h1{font-size:40px}.hero-approved p{font-size:17px}.approved-programs{padding:15px 15px 20px}.approved-programs>h2{gap:10px;font-size:23px}.approved-program-grid{gap:10px}.approved-program-grid a{min-height:155px;padding:10px 6px}.approved-program-grid strong{font-size:16px}.approved-program-grid small{font-size:12px}.itin-feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.itin-photo{width:100%;height:125px;min-height:125px}.itin-copy{margin:16px 18px;padding:0 0 0 14px}.itin-copy h3{font-size:25px}.itin-copy p{font-size:14px}.itin-feature>.approved-cta{margin:0 18px;width:max-content}}
</style>
